96
00:09:07,650 --> 00:09:10,110
I've done another job that can't get me paid.

97
00:09:10,110 --> 00:09:11,110
Wait.

98
00:09:14,610 --> 00:09:15,450
My Lord.

99
00:09:29,350 --> 00:09:30,910
She is involved in a murder case.

100
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:32,040
Arrest her first.

101
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,480
She'll be interrogated.

102
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:35,200
Go.

103
00:09:35,230 --> 00:09:36,370
Let go of me!

104
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:46,230
Kill me!

105
00:09:46,260 --> 00:09:47,150
Kill me, please!

106
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:47,980
I'm begging you.

107
00:09:47,980 --> 00:09:48,940
Kill me, please!

108
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:49,900
Please.

109
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:51,590
Kill me!

110
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:53,300
Kill me!

111
00:09:53,330 --> 00:09:54,820
Kill me!

112
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:55,440
Go.

113
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,620
Kill me!

114
00:10:03,650 --> 00:10:04,940
Jackal.

115
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:06,860
According to the rules,

116
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:09,420
