117
00:10:11,980 --> 00:10:14,440
But I'll give you payment for your hard work.

118
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,770
Han Lu.

119
00:11:24,610 --> 00:11:25,160
My Lord.

120
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:26,330
I'm sorry, My Lord.

121
00:11:27,580 --> 00:11:28,580
My Lord.

122
00:11:29,380 --> 00:11:30,330
My Lord, I'm sorry.

123
00:11:30,330 --> 00:11:30,990
My Lord.

124
00:11:30,990 --> 00:11:33,190
I'm sorry.

125
00:11:35,780 --> 00:11:36,650
My Lord.

126
00:11:41,930 --> 00:11:43,240
Get lost!

127
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,260
Come on.

128
00:12:05,990 --> 00:12:07,750
Big. Big. Big.

129
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:09,510
I bet it's small.

130
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:10,610
Here.

131
00:12:12,020 --> 00:12:13,070
Small.

132
00:12:14,330 --> 00:12:15,540
Let me try again.

133
00:12:16,570 --> 00:12:17,640
Try again.

134
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:18,690
Again.

135
00:12:19,180 --> 00:12:20,060
Go on.

136
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:22,100
I bet it's big.

137
00:12:22,140 --> 00:12:23,090
Let's try again.

138
00:12:23,490 --> 00:12:24,860
Sir, would you like

139
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:26,190
