140
00:12:26,190 --> 00:12:27,510
It's delicious.

141
00:12:27,620 --> 00:12:28,990
Who let the kid in?

142
00:12:30,370 --> 00:12:31,320
Get out!

143
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,320
Get out.

144
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:32,820
Don't make trouble.

145
00:12:32,820 --> 00:12:34,410
I hate kids.

146
00:12:34,860 --> 00:12:36,030
Bad luck.

147
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:41,140
I don't believe I'll always be unlucky.

148
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:42,140
I bet it's all big.

149
00:12:42,140 --> 00:12:43,490
Get lost.

150
00:12:53,020 --> 00:12:55,020
Give me back my wallet!

151
00:12:55,020 --> 00:12:55,980
Go away!

152
00:12:55,980 --> 00:12:57,400
Give me back my wallet!

153
00:12:57,770 --> 00:12:59,460
Give me my wallet!

154
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:01,110
-You stained my clothes.
-Give me back my wallet!

155
00:13:01,110 --> 00:13:02,610
I'll take the money as your compensation to me.

156
00:13:02,610 --> 00:13:03,620
Give me back my wallet!

157
00:13:03,620 --> 00:13:04,610
Let go!

158
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:07,730
Give me back my wallet!

159
00:13:07,830 --> 00:13:09,380
Go away!

160
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,560
Wine!

161
00:13:10,590 --> 00:13:11,980
Give me wine.

162
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:14,220
-Wine.
-Pull him away!

163
00:13:18,230 --> 00:13:19,370
Beat him!

164
00:13:19,390 --> 00:13:20,630
Hit him hard!

165
00:13:28,290 --> 00:13:30,040
Hit him hard!

166
00:13:38,730 --> 00:13:39,900
Who are you?

167
00:13:39,900 --> 00:13:40,610
What are you waiting for?

168
00:13:40,610 --> 00:13:41,480
Beat him!

169
00:13:55,610 --> 00:13:56,400
Get lost!

170
00:13:57,230 --> 00:13:58,410
Run.

171
00:14:08,230 --> 00:14:09,540
Xing?

172
00:14:09,930 --> 00:14:10,870
Wine.

173
00:14:10,950 --> 00:14:11,860
It's really you.

174
00:14:11,860 --> 00:14:13,260
I want wine.

175
00:14:13,290 --> 00:14:14,950
I told you I had seen him today.

176
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:16,420
Wine.

177
00:14:16,610 --> 00:14:17,640
Pei Xing.

178
00:14:19,230 --> 00:14:21,190
We haven't heard anything from you for so long.

179
00:14:21,190 --> 00:14:22,730
I didn't expect to see you here.

180
00:14:22,730 --> 00:14:24,530
I'm drinking. Don't interrupt.

181
00:14:25,210 --> 00:14:28,310
We are working for Lord Guo now.

182
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:30,360
We're here on a mission.

183
00:14:34,610 --> 00:14:35,610
Wine.

184
00:14:40,100 --> 00:14:41,440
When you're sober,

185
00:14:41,830 --> 00:14:44,680
