195
00:16:18,970 --> 00:16:20,680
No, no.

196
00:16:43,650 --> 00:16:48,980
[County Government Office]

197
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:49,600
Lord Yang.
[County Government Office]

198
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:49,740
Lord Yang.

199
00:16:49,770 --> 00:16:50,830
Who are they?

200
00:16:50,850 --> 00:16:52,020
How can they take the prisoner away without permission?

201
00:16:52,020 --> 00:16:53,020
Stay out of this.

202
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:53,990
