203
00:16:53,990 --> 00:16:56,020
This is against the law.

204
00:16:56,090 --> 00:16:57,050
Shut up.

205
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:04,730
Lord Han.

206
00:17:04,770 --> 00:17:06,000
Please.

207
00:17:12,060 --> 00:17:15,610
[County Government Office]

208
00:17:32,100 --> 00:17:33,830
