211
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:43,020
This is my home.

212
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:48,010
Then why am I here?

213
00:17:49,020 --> 00:17:51,110
The beggar carried you up the mountain.

214
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:53,310
He was afraid you would die on the street.

215
00:17:53,310 --> 00:17:54,560
Though we're close,

216
00:17:54,580 --> 00:17:55,790
