218
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:06,150
Well.

219
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:08,490
Your injuries are less serious this time.

220
00:18:12,650 --> 00:18:14,180
This cut is the most severe.

221
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:21,600
Looks like a woman scratched you and caused these wounds.

222
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:25,860
There's something wrong with your information this time.

223
00:18:25,860 --> 00:18:27,520
But I won't return your money.

224
00:18:28,070 --> 00:18:30,250
Chu Xiong didn't rob the jewels.

225
00:18:30,980 --> 00:18:32,340
He kidnapped a woman.

226
00:18:34,610 --> 00:18:37,010
Then she must be a special woman.

227
00:18:37,230 --> 00:18:38,960
Do you want to investigate her?

228
00:18:40,020 --> 00:18:40,940
Forget it.

229
00:18:42,860 --> 00:18:45,120
Did you gamble away all your money again?

230
00:18:49,830 --> 00:18:51,060
I'll pay up

231
00:18:51,700 --> 00:18:52,980
