232
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:57,270
It's done.

233
00:18:57,270 --> 00:19:00,530
Keep your wounds away from water in the following two days.

234
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:04,150
Do you have pills that can help me sleep well?

235
00:19:04,150 --> 00:19:05,200
Yes.

236
00:19:05,570 --> 00:19:07,100
But compared to the pills,

237
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:09,290
