293
00:26:25,420 --> 00:26:27,380
I'm a government official.

294
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:28,190
Jackal.

295
00:26:28,270 --> 00:26:29,470
Jackal.

296
00:26:29,490 --> 00:26:30,510
Guards!

297
00:26:34,210 --> 00:26:35,700
Take good care of him.

298
00:26:37,520 --> 00:26:39,820
He's our important official.

299
00:26:45,190 --> 00:26:47,140
I think I did it wrong.

300
00:27:05,380 --> 00:27:06,280
Come out.

301
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:18,230
That woman has a tough character.

302
00:27:18,230 --> 00:27:20,410
I only know that her name is Liu Zhen.

303
00:27:20,440 --> 00:27:21,970
I don't know anything else.

304
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:25,300
She was taken away by a group of people that night.

305
00:27:25,770 --> 00:27:28,290
I watch it happen and couldn't do anything.

306
00:27:28,650 --> 00:27:29,980
I asked around

307
00:27:30,740 --> 00:27:33,090
and got to know they worked for Lord Guo.

308
00:27:33,360 --> 00:27:35,730
Lord Guo is mysterious.

309
00:27:35,980 --> 00:27:37,750
I only know that he came from the Prime Minister's Mansion

310
00:27:37,750 --> 00:27:39,770
He has a Yufu-Troops-Deploying card.

311
00:27:39,770 --> 00:27:42,100
Even Lord Yang needs to follow his orders.

312
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:45,370
Recently, he hired some people to cut down trees everywhere.

313
00:27:45,370 --> 00:27:49,190
He's in a hurry to build a high platform in Mount Wuzi outside the city.

314
00:27:49,190 --> 00:27:50,710
I don't why what it is for.

315
00:27:57,030 --> 00:27:58,830
Do you still believe in justice?

316
00:28:45,750 --> 00:28:47,570
Look at you.

317
00:28:48,430 --> 00:28:50,370
You're so pitiful.

318
00:28:50,780 --> 00:28:54,570
Why didn't you choose to enjoy a luxurious life in the Prime Minister's Mansion?

319
00:28:54,570 --> 00:28:56,970
Why did you choose to be a fugitive instead?

320
00:29:00,900 --> 00:29:03,390
We just want peace.

321
00:29:04,070 --> 00:29:07,480
We don't want to stay in the place where it's full of ruthless officials.

322
00:29:07,480 --> 00:29:08,900
Please.

323
00:29:09,470 --> 00:29:11,460
Please let us go.

324
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:12,350
Fine.

325
00:29:14,700 --> 00:29:16,560
As long as you tell me everything,

326
00:29:16,650 --> 00:29:18,050
I'll do anything for you.

327
00:29:28,650 --> 00:29:30,890
I'm doing this for your own good.

328
00:29:37,980 --> 00:29:39,850
I know what you're up to.

329
00:29:39,890 --> 00:29:41,960
I won't let you succeed.

330
00:29:42,320 --> 00:29:44,190
Kill me if you dare!

331
00:29:44,190 --> 00:29:45,850
Kill me!

332
00:29:50,070 --> 00:29:52,620
I'll never kill you.

333
00:29:54,050 --> 00:29:56,460
I just don't want you to go anywhere else.

334
00:29:58,080 --> 00:30:00,040
I'm worried about you.

335
00:30:11,360 --> 00:30:12,940
Your feet are so beautiful .

336
00:30:29,820 --> 00:30:31,950
Why didn't you come until today?

337
00:30:33,260 --> 00:30:34,620
Wait for me here.

338
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,980
Now you're here. Everything will be fine.

339
00:30:39,270 --> 00:30:41,460
Lord Guo will appreciate you.

340
00:30:41,810 --> 00:30:43,070
Do you know

341
00:30:43,100 --> 00:30:44,580
that without Lord Guo,

342
00:30:44,930 --> 00:30:47,570
my bros and I wouldn't be doing so well.

343
00:30:48,070 --> 00:30:49,570
You also have a lot

344
00:30:49,570 --> 00:30:50,980
to worry about, right?

345
00:30:53,650 --> 00:30:55,320
It's different now.

346
00:30:57,820 --> 00:30:59,370
Now we do everything

347
00:30:59,890 --> 00:31:01,320
for ourselves.

348
00:31:05,730 --> 00:31:06,860
Welcome back.

349
00:31:33,820 --> 00:31:36,400
Lord Guo is in a bad mood today.

350
00:31:36,400 --> 00:31:38,140
Be careful with your words.

351
00:31:46,610 --> 00:31:47,690
Lord Guo.

352
00:31:48,620 --> 00:31:49,770
Pei Xing.

353
00:31:53,020 --> 00:31:53,810
Sit.

354
00:31:54,520 --> 00:31:55,800
Watch the show with me.

355
00:31:56,720 --> 00:31:58,850
I'm not used to sitting on a high stool.

356
00:31:59,320 --> 00:32:00,490
Excuse me.

357
00:32:12,970 --> 00:32:14,580
These wolves

358
00:32:15,280 --> 00:32:17,260
were left to starve for a few days.

359
00:32:19,390 --> 00:32:21,350
The loser of the battle down there

360
00:32:23,410 --> 00:32:25,920
will become their food today.

361
00:32:27,050 --> 00:32:29,850
To survive, they do their best to fight each other.

362
00:32:30,550 --> 00:32:33,420
How wonderful this is.

363
00:32:34,960 --> 00:32:37,190
But only these scenes

364
00:32:42,020 --> 00:32:44,520
can enable me to forget my worries.

365
00:32:46,070 --> 00:32:47,810
The weak ones

366
00:32:49,020 --> 00:32:50,820
are the strong ones' food.

367
00:32:51,320 --> 00:32:53,010
You are called Jackal.

368
00:32:54,110 --> 00:32:55,510
You know

369
00:32:57,380 --> 00:32:59,130
this very well, right?

370
00:33:05,320 --> 00:33:06,360
Good!

371
00:33:18,880 --> 00:33:20,280
Thank you, My Lord.

372
00:33:22,600 --> 00:33:24,160
He did it willingly.

373
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:27,230
No one forced him.

374
00:33:30,630 --> 00:33:33,130
It's said that during the An-Shi Rebellion,

375
00:33:33,150 --> 00:33:37,080
you and Han Lu were both soldiers in the Fufeng Camp of the Tang dynasty.

376
00:33:37,360 --> 00:33:38,820
You contributed a lot

377
00:33:38,820 --> 00:33:40,990
to quelling the rebellion in Zhaojuan Temple.

378
00:33:40,990 --> 00:33:42,740
You are a rare talent.

379
00:33:43,530 --> 00:33:45,490
If you're willing to be loyal to me,

380
00:33:45,720 --> 00:33:47,330
I'll appreciate it.

381
00:33:47,750 --> 00:33:49,450
You misunderstood.

382
00:33:49,470 --> 00:33:51,050
I'm here to negotiate.

383
00:33:52,780 --> 00:33:54,630
I'm a businessman.

384
00:33:55,800 --> 00:33:57,560
But I've been unlucky lately.

385
00:33:58,360 --> 00:33:59,380
I lost my business

386
00:34:00,070 --> 00:34:02,220
because of you.

387
00:34:08,620 --> 00:34:09,800
Han Lu.

388
00:34:11,290 --> 00:34:13,340
I misunderstood?

389
00:34:16,170 --> 00:34:17,190
Pei Xing.

390
00:34:18,740 --> 00:34:20,440
It's about a child, right?

391
00:34:38,650 --> 00:34:40,250
How much do you know about it?

392
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:42,520
I guess

393
00:34:43,690 --> 00:34:45,950
you know I’m from the Prime Minister's Mansion.

394
00:34:45,950 --> 00:34:46,770
The prime minister is old.

395
00:34:46,770 --> 00:34:48,320
But he got a son recently.

396
00:34:48,610 --> 00:34:50,010
It was great news for him.

397
00:34:50,860 --> 00:34:52,730
But that crazy woman

398
00:34:52,730 --> 00:34:54,610
stole the child

399
00:34:54,610 --> 00:34:56,740
when the child was not even a month old.

400
00:34:57,640 --> 00:34:59,520
This is a family disgrace.

401
00:35:00,840 --> 00:35:03,770
It will damage the reputation of the prime minister.

402
00:35:05,320 --> 00:35:07,580
I help the prime minister solve problems

403
00:35:08,420 --> 00:35:11,020
so I have to think carefully about everything.

404
00:35:11,590 --> 00:35:13,450
If I did anything that harmed you,

405
00:35:14,160 --> 00:35:15,480
please forgive me.

406
00:35:17,020 --> 00:35:19,230
You know where the child is?

407
00:35:21,720 --> 00:35:23,520
Ten days.

408
00:35:23,830 --> 00:35:25,000
I will bring you the child

409
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:26,040
in ten days.

410
00:35:26,070 --> 00:35:27,110
Why ten days?

411
00:35:27,110 --> 00:35:29,230
The time for me to finish my job is never longer than ten days.

412
00:35:29,230 --> 00:35:29,950
Your purpose is...

413
00:35:29,950 --> 00:35:31,230
Take back my arrest order.

414
00:35:31,230 --> 00:35:32,870
If you fail,

415
00:35:34,050 --> 00:35:35,850
I'd like to become a wolf's food.

416
00:35:36,070 --> 00:35:36,940
Deal.

417
00:35:36,940 --> 00:35:37,900
You're free.

418
00:35:39,330 --> 00:35:40,690
But remember,

419
00:35:41,480 --> 00:35:42,960
you only have ten days.

420
00:35:49,120 --> 00:35:50,320
Wait.

421
00:35:57,520 --> 00:35:59,380
I know what kind of person you are.

422
00:35:59,900 --> 00:36:01,500
This is a little gift for you.

423
00:36:02,900 --> 00:36:04,620
I'll wait for the good news.

424
00:36:19,190 --> 00:36:20,710
Stop chasing.

425
00:36:25,910 --> 00:36:29,070
Jackal's arrest order has is taken back for now.

426
00:36:30,940 --> 00:36:33,240
Who do you think you are?

427
00:36:47,570 --> 00:36:49,430
How do you know it's about a child?

428
00:36:49,470 --> 00:36:51,640
It was my guess. I took a risky bet.

429
00:36:52,730 --> 00:36:54,390
You had never won a bet before.

430
00:36:54,860 --> 00:36:56,120
But this time, you did.

431
00:36:57,970 --> 00:36:59,830
That woman just wanted to die.

432
00:36:59,830 --> 00:37:01,760
She must be protecting something.

433
00:37:02,730 --> 00:37:05,440
What's the thing that's more important than her life?

434
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:08,080
You never got involved anything related to women or children.

435
00:37:08,080 --> 00:37:08,850
How come

436
00:37:10,950 --> 00:37:11,730
this time?

437
00:37:12,990 --> 00:37:15,910
I can't forget her eyes.

438
00:37:16,760 --> 00:37:18,010
Kill me!

439
00:37:18,030 --> 00:37:19,670
Kill me!

440
00:37:21,110 --> 00:37:22,110
Kill me!

441
00:37:22,280 --> 00:37:23,500
Kill me!

442
00:37:23,560 --> 00:37:25,270
Don't kill my child.

443
00:37:26,310 --> 00:37:28,050
What's your plan?

444
00:37:31,900 --> 00:37:33,340
I need to know

445
00:37:33,370 --> 00:37:34,730
every place she went to

446
00:37:34,730 --> 00:37:35,860
and every person she met

447
00:37:35,860 --> 00:37:37,330
before she was caught.

448
00:37:37,400 --> 00:37:40,260
The sooner you give me the information, the better.

449
00:37:40,870 --> 00:37:42,520
Lord Guo's is such a powerful official.

450
00:37:42,520 --> 00:37:44,480
We're no match for him.

451
00:37:44,570 --> 00:37:46,570
If he goes back on his word...

452
00:37:47,480 --> 00:37:48,940
I know his secret.

453
00:37:49,100 --> 00:37:50,890
He doesn't dare to hurt me.

454
00:37:59,520 --> 00:38:02,240
I didn't want to get you involved.

455
00:38:02,590 --> 00:38:04,860
But I really can't find anyone else.

456
00:38:05,110 --> 00:38:06,610
You can refuse to help me.

457
00:38:06,610 --> 00:38:07,730
I know the money...

458
00:38:07,730 --> 00:38:08,730
Enough.

459
00:38:09,820 --> 00:38:11,570
What will happen in ten days

460
00:38:11,570 --> 00:38:12,610
is out of my hands.

461
00:39:04,730 --> 00:39:08,230
You're indeed a famous tracker among the bounty hunters.

462
00:39:08,570 --> 00:39:10,110
You came ahead of me.

463
00:39:10,240 --> 00:39:10,460
Shadow-erasing, you won't be able to profit from the job alone.

464
00:39:10,460 --> 00:39:13,650
[Shadow-erasing]
Shadow-erasing, you won't be able to profit from the job alone.

465
00:39:13,650 --> 00:39:13,910
[Shadow-erasing]

466
00:39:20,770 --> 00:39:22,150
Have you seen her?

467
00:39:28,570 --> 00:39:29,860
Don't be afraid.

468
00:39:30,480 --> 00:39:31,730
According to Sanya,

469
00:39:31,730 --> 00:39:34,250
a woman gave her the child and left.

470
00:39:34,400 --> 00:39:36,270
She threw a mirror to her as a reward.

471
00:39:36,270 --> 00:39:38,610
The woman said she would come back to pick up this child.

472
00:39:38,610 --> 00:39:40,730
Sanya went out every day to wait for that woman.

473
00:39:40,730 --> 00:39:42,480
Finally, you are here.

474
00:39:42,480 --> 00:39:43,480
You'd better

475
00:39:43,480 --> 00:39:45,310
take the child away right now.

476
00:39:45,310 --> 00:39:46,440
To raise my own children

477
00:39:46,440 --> 00:39:48,640
is already extremely difficult for me.

478
00:39:57,450 --> 00:39:59,720
You can't hug a child like this.

479
00:39:59,750 --> 00:40:01,950
What kind of father are you?

480
00:40:04,930 --> 00:40:05,900
Go with your father.

481
00:40:05,900 --> 00:40:06,910
Be good.

482
00:40:13,110 --> 00:40:14,180
Wait.

483
00:40:16,940 --> 00:40:18,320
Take it with you.

484
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:20,090
This is the treasure the child's mother left for her child.

485
00:40:20,090 --> 00:40:21,460
I can't keep it.

486
00:40:22,520 --> 00:40:23,980
Be good.

487
00:40:23,980 --> 00:40:25,360
Bao.

488
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:26,820
Bao?

489
00:40:26,820 --> 00:40:27,830
I gave the child the random name.

490
00:40:27,830 --> 00:40:30,920
Every child is the most precious in their parents' eyes.

491
00:40:30,920 --> 00:40:32,410
Take the food. You can eat it on your way.

492
00:40:32,410 --> 00:40:35,270
Remember to chew them into pieces and feed the baby.

493
00:41:45,010 --> 00:41:46,720
Can you stop crying?

494
00:43:02,150 --> 00:43:03,540
No.

495
00:43:04,540 --> 00:43:05,270
No!

496
00:43:05,270 --> 00:43:06,220
Kill me!

497
00:43:06,320 --> 00:43:07,320
Kill me!

498
00:43:07,320 --> 00:43:08,320
Kill me?

499
00:43:40,730 --> 00:43:43,870
So you're what enables me to have a good sleep?

500
00:43:51,730 --> 00:43:52,430
[To Jackal]

501
00:43:54,860 --> 00:43:57,660
The bounty hunter hired by Wu Shao'an is you.

502
00:44:02,650 --> 00:44:04,060
Guo Zhongxiang

503
00:44:04,170 --> 00:44:05,470
is the butler in the Prime Minister's Mansion

504
00:44:05,470 --> 00:44:06,980
He has humble origins.

505
00:44:06,980 --> 00:44:08,810
He took his mother's surname Guo.

506
00:44:08,810 --> 00:44:12,180
He is the illegitimate son of the prime minister.

507
00:44:12,320 --> 00:44:14,100
He is born to be a very patient and person.

508
00:44:14,100 --> 00:44:15,750
And he is meticulous and vicious.

509
00:44:15,750 --> 00:44:18,610
He’s in charge of the dirty business in the mansion.

510
00:44:19,030 --> 00:44:20,470
The prime minister is old.

511
00:44:20,470 --> 00:44:21,950
And his main wife doesn't bear any child.

512
00:44:21,950 --> 00:44:24,730
The dancer Liu Zhen gave birth to a son for the prime minister.

513
00:44:24,730 --> 00:44:27,340
The fortune-teller said the son was born to be extraordinary.

514
00:44:27,340 --> 00:44:28,750
The prime minister got very happy upon hearing it.

515
00:44:28,750 --> 00:44:31,280
But this caused conflicts among the different groups of people in the mansion.

516
00:44:31,280 --> 00:44:33,290
Liu Zhen escaped from the capital

517
00:44:33,330 --> 00:44:35,110
to save herself and her son.

518
00:44:35,690 --> 00:44:39,530
Guo Zhongxiang is under the prime minister's order to find the child.

519
00:44:39,530 --> 00:44:41,930
But in fact, he plotted to kill him.

520
00:44:42,290 --> 00:44:44,090
He has always dreamed of being the lawful heir of the prime minister

521
00:44:44,090 --> 00:44:46,730
and he believed in the evil magic of sorcerers in the Western Region.

522
00:44:46,730 --> 00:44:48,520
He planned to sacrifice the baby on the full-moon night of this month

523
00:44:48,520 --> 00:44:51,350
and make the baby into a pill and eat it.

524
00:44:51,440 --> 00:44:53,230
He hopes to get the child's fortunate by doing that.

525
00:44:53,230 --> 00:44:55,150
He has gone so crazy

526
00:44:55,180 --> 00:44:56,780
that he's worse than a beast.

527
00:45:05,810 --> 00:45:07,150
Wait for me here.

528
00:45:34,000 --> 00:45:35,640
Go in and report.

529
00:46:17,950 --> 00:46:19,230
Leave the child to me.

530
00:46:32,160 --> 00:46:33,290
Let's go.

531
00:46:38,440 --> 00:46:40,300
If you don't leave, I'll leave.

532
00:47:12,650 --> 00:47:14,740
You'll have us killed.

533
00:47:15,530 --> 00:47:17,520
Do one last thing for me.

534
00:47:19,220 --> 00:47:20,740
A new identity

535
00:47:21,250 --> 00:47:22,550
with a new face.

536
00:47:28,610 --> 00:47:30,870
I want to see this baby grow up.

537
00:47:31,810 --> 00:47:32,810
Bao.

538
00:48:01,650 --> 00:48:04,260
Didn't you hate kids the most?

539
00:48:04,860 --> 00:48:06,100
I still hate them now.

540
00:48:08,130 --> 00:48:09,410
Close your eyes.

541
00:48:09,480 --> 00:48:10,540
Sleep for a while.

542
00:48:10,560 --> 00:48:12,290
You'll be fine when you wake up.

543
00:48:16,080 --> 00:48:18,080
It seems to be the time for him to pee.

544
00:48:18,110 --> 00:48:18,900
Don't worry.

545
00:48:19,230 --> 00:48:21,690
I'm better at taking care of babies than you.

546
00:48:23,320 --> 00:48:24,780
In such a turbulent world,

547
00:48:25,150 --> 00:48:27,010
it is by no means easy

548
00:48:27,190 --> 00:48:29,430
for ordinary people like us to live.

549
00:48:30,070 --> 00:48:31,800
I live on the top of the mountain

550
00:48:32,110 --> 00:48:33,820
to stay away from troubles.

551
00:48:36,070 --> 00:48:38,000
Even if I will live with no dignity,

552
00:48:38,520 --> 00:48:41,320
I don't want to go back to the nightmare of the past.

553
00:48:45,230 --> 00:48:46,570
But these days,

554
00:48:46,820 --> 00:48:48,370
I feel extremely anxious.

555
00:48:51,950 --> 00:48:55,730
Why don't we stay away from this troubled place

556
00:48:56,630 --> 00:48:58,160
and start a new life?

557
00:49:00,150 --> 00:49:02,260
You even killed a child.

558
00:49:04,730 --> 00:49:06,040
Bastard!

559
00:49:23,940 --> 00:49:26,250
The traitor must be executed.

560
00:49:27,560 --> 00:49:28,450
Pei Xing.

561
00:49:29,150 --> 00:49:30,780
This is your honor.

562
00:49:33,060 --> 00:49:34,470
No!

563
00:49:34,530 --> 00:49:35,870
Don't kill my child!

564
00:49:45,970 --> 00:49:47,110
No!

565
00:49:47,110 --> 00:49:47,690
Don't kill my child!

566
00:49:47,690 --> 00:49:49,860
If you want to kill someone, kill me!

567
00:49:50,620 --> 00:49:51,790
No!

568
00:49:53,090 --> 00:49:55,000
No!

569
00:50:05,730 --> 00:50:06,730
Kill me!

570
00:50:06,730 --> 00:50:10,360
Kill me! Kill me! Kill me!

571
00:50:19,150 --> 00:50:21,430
Open your eyes and look carefully.

572
00:50:22,190 --> 00:50:23,560
On the battlefield,

573
00:50:24,100 --> 00:50:26,570
only by turning into a beast

574
00:50:26,780 --> 00:50:28,490
can you live.

575
00:50:56,660 --> 00:50:58,610
I want to add another person.

576
00:51:03,050 --> 00:51:05,790
If I don't come back before dawn,

577
00:51:06,350 --> 00:51:08,250
find a good family for this child.

578
00:51:08,650 --> 00:51:10,110
Everyone has his own fate.

579
00:51:11,070 --> 00:51:12,730
Is it worth taking risks

580
00:51:13,330 --> 00:51:15,060
for a woman whom you don't know?

581
00:51:15,380 --> 00:51:16,440
Who knows?

582
00:51:18,460 --> 00:51:21,130
Another loss.

583
00:51:28,190 --> 00:51:29,630
Liu Zhen is imprisoned here.

584
00:51:29,630 --> 00:51:30,430
I am sure of it.

585
00:51:30,610 --> 00:51:32,730
The Shadow-erasing must have cost you a lot.

586
00:51:32,730 --> 00:51:33,920
It's worthwhile.

587
00:51:34,110 --> 00:51:35,640
I will write a report

588
00:51:35,660 --> 00:51:38,390
to expose Guo Zhongxiang's evil deeds to the court.

589
00:51:38,390 --> 00:51:40,070
I will bring him to justice

590
00:51:40,070 --> 00:51:41,750
even if it will be at the cost of my career.

591
00:51:41,750 --> 00:51:43,950
This place is usually heavily guarded.

592
00:51:44,190 --> 00:51:46,110
I think they're all gone tonight.

593
00:51:46,110 --> 00:51:46,900
So strange.

594
00:51:48,010 --> 00:51:49,460
Why are you helping me?

595
00:51:51,840 --> 00:51:53,260
I want you to know

596
00:51:53,320 --> 00:51:55,270
that there's humaneness in this world.

597
00:51:55,270 --> 00:51:57,800
Where there's humaneness, there's justice.

598
00:52:02,520 --> 00:52:03,700
Stay alive.

599
00:52:04,650 --> 00:52:07,550
There are more people in this world who need you.

600
00:52:07,690 --> 00:52:09,090
Wait for me here.

601
00:52:11,440 --> 00:52:12,230
Jackal.

602
00:52:13,320 --> 00:52:15,250
I haven't known your real name yet.

603
00:52:18,270 --> 00:52:19,360
Is that important?

604
00:52:19,480 --> 00:52:21,740
I should call you by your real name.

605
00:52:23,140 --> 00:52:25,200
I'll tell you next time we meet.

606
00:53:04,700 --> 00:53:08,830
[Prostitute]

607
00:53:10,030 --> 00:53:14,610
"Don't you see the mirror bright in chamber high

608
00:53:15,280 --> 00:53:19,860
which grieves over your snow-white hair that once was silken black?"

609
00:53:34,440 --> 00:53:36,840
I was wondering why there was no guard here.

610
00:53:37,070 --> 00:53:39,930
It turns out that the big boss is here.

611
00:53:40,270 --> 00:53:42,120
It's hard for us to meet.

612
00:53:42,550 --> 00:53:45,480
We shouldn't be disturbed by others.

613
00:53:46,190 --> 00:53:47,520
What do you think?

614
00:53:47,520 --> 00:53:51,750
They even hired the Grey-Haired Master, who ranks first among all bounty hunters.

615
00:53:51,750 --> 00:53:53,530
I am so proud of myself.

616
00:53:53,670 --> 00:53:54,700
[Grey-Haired Master]

617
00:53:56,960 --> 00:53:58,010
Try it.

618
00:54:04,220 --> 00:54:05,420
Good wine.

619
00:54:06,630 --> 00:54:08,050
Good pot.

620
00:54:09,270 --> 00:54:10,650
You came to save her?

621
00:54:13,640 --> 00:54:15,720
What's your relationship with her?

622
00:54:16,500 --> 00:54:17,620
Nothing.

623
00:54:17,650 --> 00:54:20,090
There must be a reason.

624
00:54:21,550 --> 00:54:22,780
What about you?

625
00:54:25,500 --> 00:54:27,620
I'm a bounty hunter.

626
00:54:27,650 --> 00:54:29,980
I never ask anything about right or wrong.

627
00:54:30,340 --> 00:54:31,510
Jackal.

628
00:54:32,480 --> 00:54:34,830
You broke the rules.

629
00:54:36,290 --> 00:54:37,850
Looks like

630
00:54:39,400 --> 00:54:41,020
we have to fight.

631
00:54:43,640 --> 00:54:45,600
You haven't returned the pot to me.

632
00:56:43,020 --> 00:56:46,360
It's been a long time since I played so happily.

633
00:57:33,800 --> 00:57:35,470
Alright.

634
00:57:35,700 --> 00:57:37,570
We're almost done.

635
00:57:38,940 --> 00:57:40,270
Stop running.

636
00:57:40,290 --> 00:57:42,320
I can't catch up with you.

637
00:57:43,110 --> 00:57:44,440
Jackal.

638
00:57:46,280 --> 00:57:47,820
Let's end it.

639
00:58:34,990 --> 00:58:36,490
I'm curious

640
00:58:38,800 --> 00:58:41,190
why Jackal, the best businessman,

641
00:58:41,990 --> 00:58:44,650
would turn against the powerful Prime Minister

642
00:58:46,020 --> 00:58:49,290
for a child.

643
00:58:51,550 --> 00:58:53,620
I want to find out

644
00:58:54,260 --> 00:58:57,390
what's wrong with you.

645
00:58:57,820 --> 00:58:59,570
Then what have you found out?

646
00:59:00,020 --> 00:59:04,480
You are completely different from who you were.

647
00:59:06,150 --> 00:59:08,290
I envy you.

648
00:59:08,650 --> 00:59:10,830
As a martial artist,

649
00:59:12,860 --> 00:59:15,740
I've thought of countless ways to die.

650
00:59:16,850 --> 00:59:18,720
It's not bad

651
00:59:21,820 --> 00:59:23,370
to die here today.

652
00:59:27,680 --> 00:59:31,060
Actually, we all live in a big coffin.

653
00:59:32,060 --> 00:59:36,120
The only difference is the time of death.

654
00:59:38,360 --> 00:59:44,440
"I can't condescend to serve celebrities."

655
00:59:45,940 --> 00:59:52,860
"That will make me lose my hearty smile."

656
01:00:21,140 --> 01:00:22,100
Liu Zhen.

657
01:00:32,640 --> 01:00:34,080
My baby.

658
01:00:35,440 --> 01:00:37,080
Where is my baby?

659
01:00:37,170 --> 01:00:41,260
Don't worry. The baby is safe.

660
01:01:34,610 --> 01:01:36,340
I want you to see

661
01:01:36,480 --> 01:01:38,440
that there's humaneness in this world.

662
01:01:38,440 --> 01:01:40,970
Where there's humaneness, there's justice.

663
01:01:54,770 --> 01:01:55,860
Forgive me.

664
01:01:56,170 --> 01:01:57,510
I have no choice.

665
01:02:10,440 --> 01:02:11,440
Pei Xing.

666
01:02:12,820 --> 01:02:14,770
You fell behind.

667
01:02:44,610 --> 01:02:45,480
Captain.

668
01:02:48,280 --> 01:02:49,660
You fell behind too.

669
01:03:09,530 --> 01:03:10,640
It's impossible for him to survive.

670
01:03:10,640 --> 01:03:12,620
I want to see the body.

671
01:03:13,230 --> 01:03:13,940
Yes.

672
01:03:18,820 --> 01:03:22,230
Prepare everything for the sacrifice ceremony.

673
01:03:39,340 --> 01:03:42,110
The county governor Wu Shao'an and Jackal tried to rebel

674
01:03:42,110 --> 01:03:43,320
and were executed on the spot.

675
01:03:43,320 --> 01:03:44,980
I will put up a notice.

676
01:03:44,980 --> 01:03:46,520
I'll do it perfectly.

677
01:03:46,520 --> 01:03:48,170
Perfectly.

678
01:03:51,080 --> 01:03:53,080
You know too much.

679
01:03:53,190 --> 01:03:54,860
Guo... Guo...

680
01:03:59,360 --> 01:04:00,790
You smell so good.

681
01:04:01,420 --> 01:04:03,710
Why are you so excited to see me?

682
01:04:17,370 --> 01:04:18,340
Hurry up.

683
01:04:25,310 --> 01:04:26,640
Have you found the body?

684
01:04:27,570 --> 01:04:29,400
I'll report to Captain Han.

685
01:04:30,630 --> 01:04:33,160
How come that you went through so much trouble

686
01:04:33,690 --> 01:04:35,600
because of Jackal?

687
01:04:35,940 --> 01:04:37,560
Even Captain Han

688
01:04:37,770 --> 01:04:40,170
seems to be afraid of him.

689
01:04:44,150 --> 01:04:45,980
You don't know how scary he is.

690
01:04:47,410 --> 01:04:48,360
He...

691
01:04:48,360 --> 01:04:50,520
He's known as the "Undead Jackal."

692
01:05:16,490 --> 01:05:18,380
I just want to stay alive.

693
01:05:19,010 --> 01:05:21,440
You knew that we couldn't afford to offend them,

694
01:05:21,440 --> 01:05:23,740
but you got all of us involved.

695
01:05:23,860 --> 01:05:25,660
Look at what they have done to me!

696
01:05:29,230 --> 01:05:31,630
I don't want to go back to the past.

697
01:05:32,410 --> 01:05:35,040
When you went to save an outsider,

698
01:05:36,850 --> 01:05:39,200
did you think about what I would suffer?

699
01:05:44,090 --> 01:05:45,750
Where is Wu Shao'an?

700
01:05:52,100 --> 01:05:54,300
I will release his soul from purgatory.

701
01:05:58,670 --> 01:06:00,560
My name is

702
01:06:01,460 --> 01:06:02,650
Pei Xing.

703
01:06:10,760 --> 01:06:12,310
Where are you going?

704
01:06:16,700 --> 01:06:18,240
I know

705
01:06:19,020 --> 01:06:20,680
that as long as you stay away from me,

706
01:06:20,680 --> 01:06:23,040
you will have many ways to escape.

707
01:06:23,410 --> 01:06:25,620
But you didn't choose that way.

708
01:06:26,920 --> 01:06:28,600
Stay alive.

709
01:06:31,730 --> 01:06:34,230
I know the sword that Captain Han uses.

710
01:06:34,730 --> 01:06:37,280
No one can survive from that sword.

711
01:06:37,970 --> 01:06:39,700
It's the Sword of the Universe.

712
01:06:40,180 --> 01:06:42,910
It once belonged to Bai Qi, the Greatest General.

713
01:06:54,480 --> 01:06:55,800
The altar has been built.

714
01:06:55,800 --> 01:06:57,810
How do we deal with the farmers?

715
01:07:00,530 --> 01:07:02,410
Those who are involved

716
01:07:02,440 --> 01:07:03,610
must die.

717
01:07:03,630 --> 01:07:04,510
Got it.

718
01:08:00,860 --> 01:08:04,530
[Pei Xing's Tomb]

719
01:08:27,030 --> 01:08:27,790
Han Lu.

720
01:08:29,160 --> 01:08:30,640
I will repay you

721
01:08:31,190 --> 01:08:32,610
after this.

722
01:08:33,020 --> 01:08:34,520
Thank you, Lord Guo.

723
01:08:35,040 --> 01:08:36,450
I admire you

724
01:08:37,730 --> 01:08:39,700
because we are alike.

725
01:08:41,700 --> 01:08:42,830
Just remember don't pry into too much.

726
01:08:42,830 --> 01:08:45,190
As long as you are by my side,

727
01:08:45,770 --> 01:08:46,980
I will help you

728
01:08:47,490 --> 01:08:49,040
achieve your ambition.

729
01:08:54,380 --> 01:08:55,290
Remember.

730
01:08:56,180 --> 01:08:57,330
When the rain stops

731
01:08:57,620 --> 01:08:58,690
at midnight,

732
01:08:59,230 --> 01:09:00,560
the elixir will be made.

733
01:09:02,690 --> 01:09:06,090
I'll escort you.

734
01:09:54,290 --> 01:09:55,720
What are you doing here?

735
01:10:01,950 --> 01:10:03,340
Pei Xing.

736
01:10:03,370 --> 01:10:04,870
Stop being stubborn.

737
01:10:04,900 --> 01:10:06,620
Can't you just be a bounty hunter?

738
01:10:06,620 --> 01:10:08,240
Why are you against us?

739
01:10:08,270 --> 01:10:09,560
Look.

740
01:10:09,590 --> 01:10:10,230
It's not easy

741
01:10:10,230 --> 01:10:11,570
for us to reach this far.

742
01:10:11,590 --> 01:10:13,390
Are you going to ruin us?

743
01:10:16,200 --> 01:10:18,530
I've been a bounty hunter for seven years.

744
01:10:18,800 --> 01:10:21,190
I've been working for others all the time.

745
01:10:22,850 --> 01:10:24,310
Today,

746
01:10:27,080 --> 01:10:29,810
I'll do things for myself.

747
01:10:32,740 --> 01:10:34,550
Step back if you want to live.

748
01:10:35,290 --> 01:10:37,820
I don't want to see the blood of my friends.

749
01:10:42,860 --> 01:10:43,740
Soldiers

750
01:10:43,740 --> 01:10:44,950
can never retreat.

751
01:12:11,330 --> 01:12:12,600
You go now.

752
01:12:28,810 --> 01:12:30,650
What's the point of living

753
01:12:31,170 --> 01:12:32,970
when I cannot do anything right?

754
01:12:39,820 --> 01:12:41,580
The soldiers that Han Lu led

755
01:12:41,610 --> 01:12:43,620
are not capable at all.

756
01:12:43,980 --> 01:12:47,590
Just consider it as honing their skills for Lord Guo.

757
01:12:47,940 --> 01:12:50,640
You and Han Lu are somewhat alike.

758
01:12:51,870 --> 01:12:53,690
But the difference is

759
01:12:54,690 --> 01:12:57,640
Han Lu never stabbed anyone in the back.

760
01:12:58,130 --> 01:13:00,000
It would be a huge disgrace

761
01:13:00,160 --> 01:13:03,210
if I were killed by you.

762
01:13:04,460 --> 01:13:06,360
Killing is killing.

763
01:13:08,520 --> 01:13:11,820
There's no need to judge the method.

764
01:14:04,370 --> 01:14:06,360
That's what you can do?

765
01:14:07,010 --> 01:14:09,020
I'm so disappointed.

766
01:15:51,230 --> 01:15:52,350
Please.

767
01:15:52,730 --> 01:15:54,050
Please spare me.

768
01:15:54,740 --> 01:15:55,700
Please.

769
01:15:57,120 --> 01:15:58,540
Please spare me.

770
01:15:59,800 --> 01:16:01,350
Please spare me.

771
01:16:25,400 --> 01:16:26,270
Good boy.

772
01:16:26,290 --> 01:16:27,130
Bao.

773
01:16:46,500 --> 01:16:49,070
You really want to die.

774
01:16:50,080 --> 01:16:51,570
This time,

775
01:16:52,950 --> 01:16:55,010
I want to live.

776
01:17:45,990 --> 01:17:47,030
Stand up.

777
01:17:47,060 --> 01:17:48,860
Aren't you the "Undead Jackal?"

778
01:17:51,910 --> 01:17:53,190
I gave you a chance,

779
01:17:53,210 --> 01:17:54,780
but you didn't cherish it.

780
01:17:54,950 --> 01:17:57,100
We almost died.

781
01:17:57,490 --> 01:17:59,070
What was it for?

782
01:17:59,100 --> 01:18:02,300
For the lavish life of those high-ranking officials?

783
01:18:03,650 --> 01:18:06,790
We survived from piles of dead bodies.

784
01:18:07,160 --> 01:18:09,310
We deserve a better life.

785
01:18:11,410 --> 01:18:13,330
Look at you now.

786
01:18:14,210 --> 01:18:15,980
You live like a street dog.

787
01:18:18,580 --> 01:18:20,790
You are street dogs.

788
01:18:21,330 --> 01:18:22,420
It seems

789
01:18:22,740 --> 01:18:24,670
you've forgotten

790
01:18:24,710 --> 01:18:26,350
what you did before.

791
01:18:27,510 --> 01:18:29,140
I'll help you remember.

792
01:18:34,550 --> 01:18:36,550
Do you remember them?

793
01:18:38,480 --> 01:18:39,660
You...

794
01:18:41,130 --> 01:18:43,480
Don't you like saving people?

795
01:18:44,080 --> 01:18:45,100
Fine.

796
01:18:47,250 --> 01:18:49,180
Open your eyes and take a look.

797
01:18:52,320 --> 01:18:53,380
They

798
01:18:54,300 --> 01:18:56,600
will die because of you.

799
01:19:03,580 --> 01:19:05,650
Both of us are demons.

800
01:19:06,530 --> 01:19:07,930
If Buddhas won't save me,

801
01:19:09,660 --> 01:19:11,580
I'll save myself.

802
01:20:24,400 --> 01:20:26,510
Don't you want to save the kid?

803
01:20:26,540 --> 01:20:28,450
I'll kill him now.

804
01:20:32,910 --> 01:20:34,680
Let him go.

805
01:20:39,150 --> 01:20:40,200
No!

806
01:20:50,600 --> 01:20:52,630
You are really hard to kill.

807
01:20:55,240 --> 01:20:56,370
However,

808
01:20:56,570 --> 01:20:57,770
bro,

809
01:20:57,980 --> 01:20:59,390
that's enough.

810
01:21:01,370 --> 01:21:04,060
Be a smart man in the next life.

811
01:21:54,110 --> 01:21:57,930
Frost, blood and blade.

812
01:22:11,650 --> 01:22:13,690
Pei Xing.

813
01:23:35,390 --> 01:23:36,490
Come here.

814
01:23:36,700 --> 01:23:39,150
He seems happy to see you.

815
01:23:47,290 --> 01:23:49,820
Can I call this brotherhood?

816
01:23:56,170 --> 01:23:57,550
Let me hug you.

817
01:24:04,850 --> 01:24:06,420
Do you deserve it?

818
01:24:24,160 --> 01:24:24,990
Please.

819
01:24:25,010 --> 01:24:26,170
Please let me go.

820
01:24:26,210 --> 01:24:27,700
I beg you.

821
01:24:27,730 --> 01:24:29,530
I can give you whatever you want.

822
01:24:30,070 --> 01:24:31,580
Please.

823
01:24:33,370 --> 01:24:35,010
You know who's behind me.

824
01:24:35,150 --> 01:24:37,570
I'm the only one who can withdraw

825
01:24:38,380 --> 01:24:40,750
I'm here on behalf of Liu Zhen.

826
01:24:41,610 --> 01:24:43,260
No. No. No.

827
01:24:51,450 --> 01:24:52,620
It stinks.

828
01:24:53,320 --> 01:24:55,180
Pei Xing.

829
01:24:56,730 --> 01:24:59,470
Don't think you can leave.

830
01:25:01,460 --> 01:25:02,900
From now on,

831
01:25:02,930 --> 01:25:05,850
all bounty hunters in the world

832
01:25:05,910 --> 01:25:08,070
will try to kill you.

833
01:25:08,150 --> 01:25:09,980
From now on,

834
01:25:09,980 --> 01:25:12,240
you have no chance to live a peaceful life

835
01:25:12,270 --> 01:25:13,320
until

836
01:25:13,320 --> 01:25:17,020
your head falls.

837
01:25:38,360 --> 01:25:39,150
Kid.

838
01:25:40,610 --> 01:25:42,730
There are two roads ahead.

839
01:25:43,820 --> 01:25:48,090
One is a broad road to the capital

840
01:25:48,270 --> 01:25:50,530
where you can find your glory and wealth.

841
01:25:51,690 --> 01:25:56,520
The other is a path to the turbulent world.

842
01:25:57,150 --> 01:25:59,680
You need to stay with me to the end of the world.

843
01:26:02,370 --> 01:26:03,910
It's up to you.

844
01:26:23,750 --> 01:26:25,140
[Wine]

845
01:26:25,270 --> 01:26:26,400
Here comes the wine.

846
01:26:26,480 --> 01:26:27,480
Sir.

847
01:26:28,610 --> 01:26:29,620
Please enjoy your wine.

848
01:26:29,620 --> 01:26:31,220
Call me if you need anything.

849
01:26:46,840 --> 01:26:52,250
[Wanted]

850
01:26:52,780 --> 01:26:58,780
[Xie Miao as Blind Cheng]